WEBVTT

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.888
Press Option-Space,

00:00:05.158 --> 00:00:06.224
type a few letters,

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.486
and press Return.

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:09.155
Ask a question,

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.385
and it shows the passage and the page.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.567
It matches the words you use.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.478
Clipboard history keeps what you copy.

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:18.829
It is off until you turn it on,

00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:20.961
and it skips password managers.

00:00:21.737 --> 00:00:22.767
Nine ninety-nine,

00:00:23.012 --> 00:00:23.477
once,

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.291
with a seven day free trial.

